        "Substitute $y = 2 - 3x$ into the circle equation $(x - 2)^2 + (y + 4)^2 = 20$.",
        "Simplify to $10(x - 2)^2 = 20 \\implies (x - 2)^2 = 2$.",
        "Take the root $x = 2 - \\sqrt{2}$ (since $P$ lies on the segment between $x = 0$ and $x = 2$) and find $y$."
